{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "The End of History",
    "steam_appid": 2953520,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Medieval Sandbox RPG: Weave Your Destiny</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953520/extras/83ec3cbd357b54aae3196434757549ad.avif?t=1752189854\" data-has-big width=800 height=424 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300eThe End of History\u300f is a sandbox-style strategy RPG set in a medieval-inspired world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the protagonist, you leave your foster parent's home one day and embark on a journey as an unknown wanderer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where the motives of numerous NPCs intertwine, and cooperation and betrayal collide,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you become a part of this world and can live freely as you choose.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stop the Collapse of the World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953520/extras/375633eaaec3193bf1e85ccad8209019.avif?t=1752189854\" data-has-big width=800 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is singular: to stop the collapse of the world. The world is heading towards destruction fueled by rising hatred and division. Every action has consequences, and you must observe their effects carefully.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Live Freely</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953520/extras/bd2b618dc5db8c657045035f303a7b1c.avif?t=1752189854\" data-has-big width=800 height=370 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From being a nameless entity to becoming a thief, trader, knight, or even a king, your existence in the world is up to you. Your choices shape your destiny.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >'Obelisk' Mystery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953520/extras/f8db0a0e18b4f6ed73565c015ea99421.avif?t=1752189854\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This massive and mysterious structure holds the wisdom of a seemingly infinite world. Its existence is now shrouded in mystery, with fragments scattered across the world to piece together its secrets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Unique Story\u2500\u2500<br>This is not a heroic tale, but a record of historical observation.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953520/extras/d88fc31a22edce6864057f618156981c.avif?t=1752189854\" data-has-big width=800 height=560 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The aftermath of battles, the words exchanged, the small, forgotten choices\u2500\u2500</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >all of these stir emotions and change actions. NPCs will continue to live their lives without you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, your decisions create ripples in their stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game does not depict a predetermined scenario, but a unique and unrepeatable history</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >born from the player's involvement.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Medieval Sandbox RPG: Weave Your Destiny</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953520/extras/83ec3cbd357b54aae3196434757549ad.avif?t=1752189854\" data-has-big width=800 height=424 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300eThe End of History\u300f is a sandbox-style strategy RPG set in a medieval-inspired world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the protagonist, you leave your foster parent's home one day and embark on a journey as an unknown wanderer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where the motives of numerous NPCs intertwine, and cooperation and betrayal collide,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you become a part of this world and can live freely as you choose.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stop the Collapse of the World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953520/extras/375633eaaec3193bf1e85ccad8209019.avif?t=1752189854\" data-has-big width=800 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is singular: to stop the collapse of the world. The world is heading towards destruction fueled by rising hatred and division. Every action has consequences, and you must observe their effects carefully.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Live Freely</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953520/extras/bd2b618dc5db8c657045035f303a7b1c.avif?t=1752189854\" data-has-big width=800 height=370 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From being a nameless entity to becoming a thief, trader, knight, or even a king, your existence in the world is up to you. Your choices shape your destiny.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >'Obelisk' Mystery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953520/extras/f8db0a0e18b4f6ed73565c015ea99421.avif?t=1752189854\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This massive and mysterious structure holds the wisdom of a seemingly infinite world. Its existence is now shrouded in mystery, with fragments scattered across the world to piece together its secrets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Unique Story\u2500\u2500<br>This is not a heroic tale, but a record of historical observation.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953520/extras/d88fc31a22edce6864057f618156981c.avif?t=1752189854\" data-has-big width=800 height=560 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The aftermath of battles, the words exchanged, the small, forgotten choices\u2500\u2500</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >all of these stir emotions and change actions. NPCs will continue to live their lives without you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, your decisions create ripples in their stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game does not depict a predetermined scenario, but a unique and unrepeatable history</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >born from the player's involvement.</p>",
    "short_description": "A Strategy RPG where you live freely in a vast medieval feudal-simulated sandbox. Listen to the requests of the citizens, trade, plunder, serve, own a territory as a noble, usurp the throne, endless wars, and betrayal. The intertwining of your and numerous NPCs' intentions creates unique stories.",
